  "prefLabel": "Plc 1507.02 Licensee Responsibilities for Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1507.02 Licensee Responsibilities for Renewal. Each licensee shall:\n\n(a) Know when the licensee’s license is due to expire; and\n\n(b) Except for holders of a temporary license or conditional license, file an application for renewal prior to the expiration of the current license in accordance with Plc 1508 if the licensee wishes to continue to practice in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) #13496, INTERIM, eff 11-27-22; ss by #13621, eff 5-22-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 1500) ss by #13839, eff 12-28-23 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Plc 1500)",
